      "writtenOn": "2023-08-11T17:46:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I do not think these hooks are acceptable due to their sensitive nature (e.g. the dm-verity one) and the fact that there is no genuine issue, such as a dependency on hardware not supported by the upstream kernel, that is blocking the upstreaming of your fix. This problem needs to be solved upstream first.\n\nYou should also consider using the `try_verify_in_tasklet option` for dm-verity, as well as making sure you have the commit `dm verity: enable WQ_HIGHPRI on verify_wq` which enabled the HIGHPRI flag on the dm-verity workqueue. These may have already solved your problem.",
      "parentUuid": "d9300b7f_c1744508",
